1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,674
The second attempt was built on a large sheet of paper with a strict charter beside it.

2
00:00:04,674 --> 00:00:11,908
“The committee must explain the plan to the nation in the context of the war,” the technician said.

3
00:00:11,908 --> 00:00:26,237
“We have cash for one month, a licence for one line, and a grade of patience that is nearly exhausted.” Their approach had to change, and they realized it together.

4
00:00:26,237 --> 00:00:32,216
The collective load was carried by a wagon, a tractor, and a portable radio.

5
00:00:32,216 --> 00:00:49,934
“A brand is not a blade,” the marine said, “and a grip is not a temple.” A duck on the deck, a candle in the lodge, and a crab in the bucket: the wild harbour had every kind of cargo except a timetable.

6
00:00:49,934 --> 00:00:57,508
The extensive survey had one fault: it measured speed and mileage but not the subway ride home.

7
00:00:57,508 --> 00:01:05,043
“A pirate on the curb can steal a bicycle faster than we can chart a flood,” the engineer said.

8
00:01:05,043 --> 00:01:11,492
“What we need is a bumper and a sheet of plywood, not another report.”

9
00:01:11,492 --> 00:01:19,146
The dove on the roof, the second watch of the night, and the sail of the fishing boat marked the hours.

10
00:01:19,146 --> 00:01:37,499
“Bondage is a strong word,” Aisha said, “but a timetable that ignores the elbow of a crowded deck is a kind of bondage.” Their own committee could not explain that sentence to the ministry, so they printed it without explanation.

11
00:01:37,499 --> 00:01:43,248
The film of the trial was late, as usual, and the short season was over.

12
00:01:43,248 --> 00:01:49,738
They had to obtain one more month, and they had to relate the new plan to the old one.

13
00:01:49,738 --> 00:01:53,797
“Speak plainly,” the committee chair said.

14
00:01:53,797 --> 00:02:03,006
“Understand that we do not own the road.” The stop, the walk, and the fly on the window were all in the final shot.

15
00:02:03,006 --> 00:02:16,195
The approach, the plan, the fact, and the film were all late; the committee had to explain, once more, how they had obtained the licence with their own cash and a short season.

16
00:02:16,195 --> 00:02:22,184
“We realize that a royal charter is not a plain licence,” she said.

17
00:02:22,184 --> 00:02:32,068
“We must speak to the people who walk and stop at the station.” The season was over, and the second attempt had one month left.

18
00:02:32,068 --> 00:02:38,113
A crate of china and a meter of cable were still on the deck.
